  "title": "Asian-German Fusion Potato Salad",
  "description": "This is a creamy German-style potato salad with a tremendous flavor given from Asian ingredients! I made this up on a whim and everyone loved it. I add ham, but feel free to leave it out - it won&#39;t alter the flavor much, just the texture.",
  "authors": [
